00:21:11,510 --> 00:21:19,590
isolation and durability and we tend to describe ourselves as a vector search engine because we prioritize scalability,

195
00:21:19,590 --> 00:21:25,510
search speed and availability over these four database principles.

196
00:21:25,510 --> 00:21:36,630
So that also requires different architectural decisions to be made and these decisions can be easily reproduced in any relational or NoSQL database.

